TITLE: Pytest discharges every aircraft software requirement
STATEMENT: >>>
The test plan shall discharge every AC-SRS item by pytest examples named in the software test description. This CSCI has no formal proof and no property-based campaign. A failing pytest shall fail the aircraft-test make target. Acceptance is a trace from each AC-SRS item to one AC-STD item.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The verification method is named before the test report treats a run as evidence.
<<<
